ActiveForm::end(); ?>\n```\n\nAs you see ActiveForm has an option `enableClientScript` disabled. I expect do not see `script` tags in my html code. But it still generates following:\n\n```\n<script src=\"/partners/assets/3ebb7d26/jquery.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/partners/assets/86319d7b/yii.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/partners/assets/86319d7b/yii.validation.js\"></script>\n```\n\nNow if I remove both fields and submit button, there is no `script` anymore. Also `script` does not generates if ActiveForm has also `enableClientValidation` disabled. Why we need both `enableClientScript` and `enableClientValidation` disabled (false) to prevent assets loading? Maybe single `enableClientScript` is enough?\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/64524704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"anton-p-ivanov","id":1772714,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzI3MTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1772714?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anton-p-ivanov","html_url":"https://github.com/anton-p-ivanov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anton-p-ivanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anton-p-ivanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anton-p-ivanov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anton-p-ivanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anton-p-ivanov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anton-p-ivanov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anton-p-ivanov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anton-p-ivanov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anton-p-ivanov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":fals